# Page builder

The public site is now the three-section content model (see `content-model.mdc`). The visual page builder remains for leftover `pages` in admin, not for the homepage.

Pages are built from a **tree** of components (`page_components.parentId` + `position`).

## Kinds

| Kind | Role |
|---|---|
| `TEXT` | HTML body |
| `IMAGE` | Single linked storage file |
| `IMAGE_GALLERY` | Ordered files + display template |
| `PAGE_GALLERY` | Links to other pages |
| `COLUMNS` | Layout container; children nest via `parentId` |

Public render walks **root** components (`parentId IS NULL`) in order; `COLUMNS` recursively renders children.

Add a kind by implementing `Kind` + templates + admin `edit`/`preview` twig, then register in `KindCollection`.

## Visual builder (primary admin UX)

Primary edit surface: `/admin/pages/{id}/builder` (Czech florist UI). Classic table UI remains at `/admin/pages/{id}` as “Klasické úpravy”.

- Canvas reuses public Twig + `builder` chrome (`Admin/Pages/Builder/block.twig`)
- Mutations via JSON under `admin.pages.builder.*` (value, tree, create, delete, fragment)
- TEXT HTML is sanitized server-side (`App\Classes\Html\Sanitizer`); TinyMCE **Styly**: Štítek / Titul / Perex / Nadpis / Odstavec / Odstavec kurzívou / Důrazný odstavec (`text-eyebrow`, `text-lead`, `text-prose`, `text-statement`)
- New diary posts: **Nový příspěvek** → `PostScaffolder` (dated path, title `TEXT` + IMAGE + TEXT + IMAGE_GALLERY, prepend homepage diary `PAGE_GALLERY`)
- Non-homepage first root block gets `page-header` styling; homepage first root gets `site-hero`
- Builder UI copy is Czech only (Fotka, Galerie fotek, …) — never show kind codes in chrome
- Frontend: `static/javascript/builder/` → `public/javascript/builder.js` (bundles SortableJS + self-hosted TinyMCE); styles in `static/scss/3-blocks/builder.scss`
- Gallery photos: drag reorder + move between galleries / onto Fotka / onto “+ Přidat sem” (new Fotka); per-photo delete + captions; PAGE_GALLERY entries reorder on canvas and in the odkazy drawer; between-block “+ Přidat sem”; layout drawer for column min/max on Sloupce / galleries

## Import from efemer.cz

```bash
docker compose exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Pages.ImportEfemerCz -f
```

Wipes existing pages, recreates homepage (intro `TEXT` + Principy / Já / Pro vás + diary `PAGE_GALLERY`) and all diary posts (title `TEXT` + hero `IMAGE` + optional body `TEXT` + `IMAGE_GALLERY`). Images go to GCS bucket `efemer`. For the content-model ingest pipeline use `App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshEfemerCz` instead.
